abstract: >-
  Deterministic astronomical (Swiss Ephemeris pyswisseph, < 1.5 ms execution,
  Zero-Auth, Rule 14 Zero-Knowledge Privacy) and 7-Wisdoms ephemeris oracle
  uniting Tropical Astronomy, Mayan Tzolkin (260-day count), Vedic Sidereal
  Jyotish (Lahiri Ayanamsa, 27 Nakshatras), Chinese Bazi & Wu Xing, 64 I-Ching
  Hexagrams, 72 Kabbalistic Shem HaMephorash Angels & Tree of Life Sephiroth,
  and Pythagorean Numerology. Speaks the Linux Foundation / AAIF Agent2Agent
  (lf.a2a.v1 v1.0.0 & v0.3.0 with RFC 8785 JCS + RFC 7515 ES256 JWS signatures)
  and Model Context Protocol (MCP 2026-07-28). Awarded Linux Foundation OpenSSF
  Best Practices Gold Badge (#16118 — 300% tiered) and Glama TDQS Grade A (4.7/5.0).
